# Item sets
Barrows and armour sets against their component pieces.

```table
Method                                          Cost    Profit     ROI
-----------------------------------------  ---------  --------  ------
Combine pieces into Verac's armour set       817,454   106,123   13.0%
Combine pieces into Karil's armour set     1,433,288    89,175    6.2%
Combine pieces into Dharok's armour set    3,939,270    79,760    2.0%
Combine pieces into Ahrim's armour set     3,393,312    66,088    1.9%
Combine pieces into Torag's armour set     1,009,503    50,761    5.0%
Combine pieces into Guthan's armour set      717,377    20,227    2.8%
Break Guthan's armour set into its pieces    752,657   -49,627   -6.6%
Break Torag's armour set into its pieces   1,081,902   -92,586   -8.6%
Break Verac's armour set into its pieces     942,425  -141,319  -15.0%
Break Karil's armour set into its pieces   1,553,533  -148,909   -9.6%
Break Ahrim's armour set into its pieces   3,530,000  -204,552   -5.8%
Break Dharok's armour set into its pieces  4,101,051  -240,566   -5.9%
```
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-verac-make Combine pieces into Verac's armour set
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-karil-make Combine pieces into Karil's armour set
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-dharok-make Combine pieces into Dharok's armour set
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-ahrim-make Combine pieces into Ahrim's armour set
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-torag-make Combine pieces into Torag's armour set
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-guthan-make Combine pieces into Guthan's armour set
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-guthan-break Break Guthan's armour set into its pieces
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-torag-break Break Torag's armour set into its pieces
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-verac-break Break Verac's armour set into its pieces
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-karil-break Break Karil's armour set into its pieces
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-ahrim-break Break Ahrim's armour set into its pieces
=> /ge/calc-itemset/set-dharok-break Break Dharok's armour set into its pieces

## Notes
* Rows marked "no price" reference an item nobody has traded recently, so no profit can be computed for them honestly.

